{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":303293,\"title\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Relive the glory days of the National Wrestling Alliance through Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling's weekly television show.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fqiGgPj7PzenuWjIL9hPrXvJWAm.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/duMUbu5jJ2piU5NxYLwL1JC1cT1.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1981,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":6,\"totalEpisodes\":204,\"createdBy\":[\"Jim Crockett Promotions\"],\"networks\":[\"Syndication\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"1986-05-17\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5756003,\"name\":\"Gary L. Ryan\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5757603,\"name\":\"Tom Osiecki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"IIku22Syk8U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"fau5V634w-8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"N-D4zxivNtE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":281671,\"title\":\"WWE Superstar Profiles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTOC5twk3sWIX2JEM99aeJHBuaK.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42400000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":3894,\"title\":\"WWE ECW\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h3qIiG22Uy62ZgLLtXkh5PdfiSL.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4217391304347826,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":533,\"title\":\"WWE Velocity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/usNc42eETTOWsGOTj9HlYwfQi5H.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42054794520547945,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":283534,\"title\":\"WWE EVOLVE\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mc169yrBwZiKKctPPkgYITAmeur.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41071428571428575,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31991,\"title\":\"WWE NXT\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9nLBX5Bf7PW4FAaWJLXpFFdeTlV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41000000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":281397,\"title\":\"WWE Raw Top 10\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9icfOPDnkZlvuen08OHbrjY4IwB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4090909090909091,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":61928,\"title\":\"Lucha Underground\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/by1AztJ9I1gjWKPL3XdYxiFOU5T.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4083333333333334,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2888,\"title\":\"WWE Confidential\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1nyAIu28i0l5qehmgc4kGv4Ku7B.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4066666666666667,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":281678,\"title\":\"WWE Raw Classics\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f6xIVdQeAKVL8qZR1500MKUTtLe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - 1984\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Relive the glory days of the National Wrestling Alliance through Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling. This season, see countless WWE Hall of Famers in action such as Dusty Rhodes, Tully Blanchard, and more.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fqiGgPj7PzenuWjIL9hPrXvJWAm.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"1984-01-14\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jan. 14, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Paul Jones looks to further humiliate Jimmy Valiant by showing off his recent spoil of war. With championship gold around his waist, Dick Slater lets everyone know the next accolade in his sights. Plus, Greg Valentine, Ernie Ladd, The Assassins, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eKhmXUXKEOSMSeDN7gtXgK2zFYa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-01-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jan. 21, 1984\",\"overview\":\"NWA World Heavyweight Champion Ric Flair vows to teach NWA United States Heavyweight Champion Dick Slater a lesson as the competitors engage in singles action. Plus, Dory Funk Jr. partners with Rufus R. Jones to take on The Assassins in a Tag Team Match.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xARrmKwN1m647977i8D8UyTLxgF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-01-21\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jan. 28, 1984\",\"overview\":\"Angelo Mosca Jr. looks to put gold around his waist as he battles Ivan Koloff for the coveted Mid-Atlantic Heavyweight Championship. Plus, NWA United States Heavyweight Champion Dick Slater continues to pursue another championship and Rufus R. Jones takes on Hans Schroeder.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5WGmDuAD0nKqwuGDKbdfo5BTbOY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-01-28\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Feb. 04, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Angelo Mosca Jr. has another golden opportunity at his fingertips when he once again challenges Ivan Koloff for the Mid-Atlantic Heavyweight Championship. The tournament to crown a new NWA Television Champion sees Mark Youngblood go one-on-one with Barry Orton. All this and much more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gDrJHUtSm8UvBwrtcJZqUx89P8w.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-02-04\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Feb. 11, 1984\",\"overview\":\"Jimmy Valiant partners with Dory Funk Jr. to take on Paul Jones' Assassins in a Tag Team Match. The NWA Television Title Tournament continues with Ernie Ladd taking on Greg Valentine in action. Plus, The Great Kabuki takes to the ring for singles competition and NWA United States Heavyweight Champion Dick Slater faces Sam Houston.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/38hqoIKSYbBIZVx0DxlOyiKBqvu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-02-11\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Feb. 25, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, the tournament to crown a new NWA Television Champion continues with Dory Funk Jr. going one-on-one with NWA United States Heavyweight Champion Dick Slater. Mark Youngblood and Wahoo McDaniel battle NWA World Tag Team Champions Bob Orton Jr. and Don Kernodle. All this and much more action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4YWcLZlFfuGB8waxnwtbHr3Ds3w.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-02-25\",\"runtime\":38},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jun. 16, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, things get exotic when Adrian Street goes one-on-one with Jimmy Valiant. Long before their days riding together as The Four Horsemen, Tully Blanchard and NWA World Heavyweight Champion Ric Flair find themselves at odds. Plus, The Road Warriors, Rufus R. Jones, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ijd55ne62zWpo6RYmk0gYmwvMF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-06-16\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jun. 23, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Ric Flair shows everyone what it means to be the NWA World Heavyweight Champion by revisiting some significant moments in his career. Things break down when Paul Jones leads his Assassin to the ring to go one-on-one with Rufus R. Jones. All this and much more action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8UjbGScPpVKnLRp4g1vw0E6XlBN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-06-23\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jun. 30, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Brian Adidas and 'Pistol' Pez Whatley take to the ring for action to send a message to NWA World Tag Team Champions Don Kernodle and Ivan Koloff. Plus, Wahoo McDaniel addresses Ricky Steamboat's chase for the NWA World Heavyweight Title, Angelo Mosca Jr. battles Doug Vines, and more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b1tnq6ZwjJXT4ckgqd3SoKWtNMS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-06-30\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jul. 07, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Terry Gordy and Buddy Roberts of The Fabulous Freebirds take to the ring to compete in a Tag Team Match. Kamala battles two opponents in a Handicap Match. Plus, a Six-Man Tag Team Match, Adrian Street sends a message to Paul Jones, and much more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jbigOH13L1iPQcpNiMLSrnjiMcu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-07-07\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jul. 14, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Ric Flair shows the world what it means to be NWA World Heavyweight Champion by taking to the ring to go one-on-one with Gary Royal. Jimmy Valiant partners with Rufus R. Jones and Adrian Street for a Six-Man Tag Team Match. Plus, The Assassins, Buzz Sawyer, and more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4gArVhIKgBHO77epYE4g7AfHKGj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-07-14\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jul. 21, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Sam Houston takes to the ring to once again challenge Tully Blanchard for the NWA Television Championship. After being fined for their recent actions, The Renegade and Mark Youngblood compete in a Tag Team Match. Plus, Buzz Sawyer, The Assassins, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1zhW6y68IFRCxJggfGJh4p9fnon.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-07-21\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Jul. 28, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, a veritable clash of champions sees Don Kernodle and The Russians take on Rufus R. Jones, Tom Shaft, and Angelo Mosca Jr. in a Six-Man Tag Team Match. Before defending his NWA Television Title, Tully Blanchard leads Wahoo McDaniel to the ring for action against Sam Houston. All this and more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tc6bBinOJuVXkSXD1pf4S9pvRVl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-07-28\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Aug. 04, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Dusty Rhodes takes to the ring for action by going one-on-one with Gary Royal. Brian Adidas and Pez Whatley take on Buzz Sawyer and Jesse Barr in a Tag Team Match. Plus, Wahoo McDaniel, Rufus R. Jones, Nikita Koloff, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/atyK7wgHlw1Ag5OAhpwlnFGGJf5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-08-04\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Aug. 11, 1984\",\"overview\":\"Rufus R. Jones & Pez Whatley battle the NWA World Tag Team Champions Ivan Koloff & Don Kernodle. Plus, Ric Flair tracks down Black Jack Mulligan, NWA Television Champion Tully Blanchard & Wahoo McDaniel take on Vinny Valentino & Sam Houston in the main event, and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7nBNKRLOt02jXArBtpmymAbbVUA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-08-11\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Aug. 18, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this episode of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Wahoo McDaniel and NWA Television Champion Tully Blanchard address their new alliance against the likes of Dusty Rhodes. Plus, Blackjack Mulligan speaks out on his recent invitation to return, Mid-Atlantic Heavyweight Champion Angelo Mosca Jr. takes on Gary Royal, and much more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yLoOzOZbdu55oWTPwZXZhrwDxaR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-08-18\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Aug. 25, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this episode of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, NWA World Tag Team Champions Ivan Koloff and Don Kernodle take to the ring to compete in a Tag Team Match. NWA Television Champion Tully Blanchard answers Dusty Rhodes' challenge. Plus, Wahoo McDaniel, Jimmy Valiant, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z5gLlkSugreH3FWkFfFcWHdX7gF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-08-25\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Sep. 01, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this episode of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Wahoo McDaniel and Tully Blanchard's rivalry with Ric Flair and Dusty Rhodes explodes when McDaniel takes to the ring to battle Dennis Brown. Plus, The Long Riders compete in a Tag Team Match, Mike Rotundo goes one-on-one with Gary Royal, and much more action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljTnY9eaUJQDFWfc99KodUcL3db.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-09-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Sep. 08, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this episode of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Barry Windham begins a pursuit of the vacant NWA United States Heavyweight Championship by taking to the ring to go one-on-one with Doug Vines. Plus, The Russians compete in a Six-Man Tag Team Match, Mike Rotundo readies for action, and much more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bzJ7UVNhsgRyiu6QzlzdewRwm56.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-09-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Sep. 15, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Dusty Rhodes looks to test his strength against Nikita Koloff in an Arm Wrestling Match. Brian Adidas and Sam Houston team up to take on NWA World Tag Team Champions Don Kernodle and Ivan Koloff. Plus, Barry Windham, Mark Youngblood, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5URFnRvF7ZSftA1NmXcoBXAzxuI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-09-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Sep. 22, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Mike Rotundo looks to make a name for himself by taking to the ring to go one-on-one with Mid-Atlantic Heavyweight Champion Ron Bass. Plus, Wahoo McDaniel partners with NWA Television Champion Tully Blanchard for a Tag Team Match, Dusty Rhodes competes in singles action, and much more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vnpWi3fcfC0Kw4WXP8N65gz58c6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-09-22\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Sep. 29, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this episode of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Wahoo McDaniel prepares for the upcoming tournament to crown a new NWA United States Heavyweight Champion by partnering with Tully Blanchard for a Tag Team Match. Plus, Nikita Koloff battles two opponents in a Handicap Match, Brian Adidas takes on Black Bart, and much more action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nxbLSLvIlE5CM6HpH9VvzwffP4Y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-09-29\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Oct. 06, 1984\",\"overview\":\"Sandy Scott gives the wresting world an update on the upcoming tournament to crown a new NWA United States Heavyweight Champion. After taking to the ring for singles competition, Mike Rotundo issues a challenge to Angelo Mosca Jr. for the Mid-Atlantic Heavyweight Title. Plus, Manny Fernandez and Mark Youngblood are in action.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hh8Wyouz32kPsjVlZ5U2Zq209zg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-10-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Oct. 13, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Mike Rotundo and Brian Adidas take to the ring to battle The Long Riders in a Tag Team Match main event. Tully Blanchard puts the NWA Television Championship on the line against Sam Houston. Plus, Barry Windham, Nikita Koloff, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xyYHZf0YEGSr9wly2RpkgEduArs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-10-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Oct. 20, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, everyone eagerly awaits the announcement of what the main event of Starrcade '84 will be. The Russians take to the ring to compete in a Six-Man Tag Team Match. Paul Jones and Jimmy Valiant prepare for their upcoming Tuxedo Match. Plus, Mike Rotundo, Manny Fernandez, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1is6QWofn1yLwo9V7vB5HqmvBwl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-10-20\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Oct. 27, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, more than gold is on the line when Brian Adidas challenges Tully Blanchard for the NWA Television Championship. Plus, The Long Riders take to the ring to compete in a Tag Team Match, NWA United States Heavyweight Champion Wahoo McDaniel in action, and much more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1kTLuKaynhufXtLSplJFZ3CJNIx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-10-27\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Nov. 03, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Brian Adidas goes after gold once again by challenging Tully Blanchard for the NWA Television Championship. The Russians send a message to NWA World Tag Team Champions Dusty Rhodes and Manny Fernandez. Plus, Dick Slater, The Long Riders, and more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sPbLe7wookir5d4j2FCZznLwmrV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-11-03\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Nov. 10, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, a furious Ricky Steamboat makes his presence felt when Ron Bass takes to the ring to go one-on-one with Tommy Lane. Don Kernodle gives everyone an update on his recent injury. Plus, Manny Fernandez competes in singles action, Dick Slater takes on Gary Royal, and much more!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vgv9POxQyRsRiqsYsHRxosIaNu7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-11-10\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Nov. 17, 1984\",\"overview\":\"Heated words over an upcoming bout between NWA World Heavyweight Champion Ric Flair and Dusty Rhodes leads to a ferocious altercation. Plus, Don Kernodle enlists the assistance of an unexpected ally and The Long Riders battle Dick Slater and Ricky Steamboat in a Tag Team Match.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/isl7WyVU9sZDUwSHMsOugv6kQBS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-11-17\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Nov. 24, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Joe Frazier lets everyone know who will be calling the shots when Ric Flair and Dusty Rhodes meet for the NWA World Heavyweight Championship at Starrcade. Plus, Wahoo McDaniel and Tully Blanchard take to the ring for a Tag Team Match, Buzz Tyler takes on Paul Kelly, and much more action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6J6xyINrfEYd9yMmaqw7deHFydm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-11-24\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Dec. 01, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Ricky Steamboat and Dick Slater take to the ring to battle The Long Riders in a huge Tag Team Match. The territory braces for the arrival of Magnum T.A. and his already growing reputation. Plus, Wahoo McDaniel, Ivan Koloff, and more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ABWrcHL9ifGcDfOhgV13yA3tiD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-12-01\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Dec. 08, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, violence erupts when Mid-Atlantic Tag Team Champions The Long Riders take to the ring to compete in a Tag Team Match. Plus, Manny Fernandez gears up for singles competition, Buzz Tyler goes one-on-one with George South, and much more action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wuu4qMUVBZu2NGRQxjouJZvXHYt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-12-08\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Dec. 15, 1984\",\"overview\":\"On this edition of Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling, Ron Bass puts the coveted Mid-Atlantic Heavyweight Championship on the line against Ricky Steamboat in the main event. Dick Slater and Manny Fernandez battle the team of Joel Deaton and Gary Royal. Plus, The Russians, Buzz Tyler, and many more take to the ring for action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8m20VL9sszdOAj0vrSZ41T98CUV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-12-15\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Dec. 22, 1984\",\"overview\":\"With NWA World Heavyweight Champion Ric Flair breathing down his neck, Wahoo McDaniel defends the NWA United States Heavyweight Title. Plus, Tully Blanchard partners with The Long Riders for a Six-Man Tag Team Match against Sam Houston, Mike Davis, and Tommy Lance.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ePuWkYfO4sy5qtL7xoh0XsbyjkI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-12-22\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":35,\"name\":\"Mid-Atlantic Championship Wrestling - Dec. 29, 1984\",\"overview\":\"With 1985 on the horizon, David Crockett takes everyone on a nostalgic journey through the best of 1984, featuring highlights of the most memorable moments and matches from that year. In this look back in time, see the likes of Tully Blanchard, Dusty Rhodes, Wahoo McDaniel, and many more in action!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jHtyGifNPMwNyFookfH6M4YH2wn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1984-12-29\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"1981-09-12\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}